<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: trees purged -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_purged.label>根除了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_purged.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed a gratifyingly large number of trees. Each fallen trunk brings us closer to a better world. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_purged.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了多到数不清的树木。每个光秃秃的树桩都会让我们的世界变得更美好。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_purged.description>
  <!-- EN: trees cleared -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cleared.label>净除了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cleared.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed an impressive number of trees. The land looks better already! -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cleared.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了数量庞大的树木。这片土地现在看起来棒极了！</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cleared.description>
  <!-- EN: trees removed -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_removed.label>铲除了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_removed.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we got rid of a satisfying number of trees. This was necessary progress. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_removed.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了大量的树木。此乃必然的进步。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_removed.description>
  <!-- EN: trees cut down -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cut_down.label>移除了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cut_down.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed a commendable number of trees. The space feels more open and free now. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cut_down.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了许多的树木。附近的空间变得更加广阔和自由了。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_cut_down.description>
  <!-- EN: trees dealt with -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_dealt_with.label>砍伐了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_dealt_with.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed a reasonable number of trees. It had to be done, and it feels good to have it behind us. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_dealt_with.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了较多的树木。我们必须坚持这一使命，并通过将其完成来获得满足。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_dealt_with.description>
  <!-- EN: trees thinned -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_thinned.label>处理了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_thinned.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed some trees. It’s a step in the right direction, but there’s still more work to do. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_thinned.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了一些树木。我们正朝着正确的方向稳步迈进，但还需要做更多努力。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_thinned.description>
  <!-- EN: trees disturbed -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.label>扰乱了树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we destroyed a few trees. It’s progress, but hardly worth celebrating. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.description>在过去的一个象里，我们摧毁了少量的树木。这算得上是一种进步，但还不值得我们为之庆贺。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_disturbed.description>
  <!-- EN: trees untouched -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_untouched.label>未积极摧毁树木</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_untouched.label>
  <!-- EN: In the past quadrum, we didn’t destroy many trees at all. It’s disappointing to see so little improvement. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_untouched.description>在过去的一个象里，我们只摧毁了极少的树木。我们没有努力改善这个世界，真是令人失望。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.trees_untouched.description>
  
  <!-- EN: repulsive forests -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.repulsive_forests.label>可憎的森林</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.repulsive_forests.label>
  <!-- EN: I am surrounded by several massive, ugly trees. The sight of these overgrown eyesores repulses me! -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.repulsive_forests.description>我被许多粗壮且丑陋的树所包围。看到这些如同杂草般疯长的可憎之物让我火大到不行！</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.repulsive_forests.description>
  <!-- EN: abominable trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.abominable_trees.label>恶心的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.abominable_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I very recently encountered a massive, ugly tree – a blight on the land! -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.abominable_trees.description>我最近看到了一棵粗壮且丑陋的树——它简直就是这片土地上的毒瘤！</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.abominable_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: disgraceful forests -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.disgraceful_forests.label>腐化的森林</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.disgraceful_forests.label>
  <!-- EN: I am surrounded by a vile, overgrown forest. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.disgraceful_forests.description>我被污秽蔓生的森林所包围。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.disgraceful_forests.description>
  <!-- EN: blighted trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blighted_trees.label>丑陋的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blighted_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I recently encountered a massive, ugly tree. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blighted_trees.description>我最近看到了一棵粗壮且丑陋的树。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blighted_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: corrupted forest -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.corrupted_forest.label>讨厌的森林</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.corrupted_forest.label>
  <!-- EN: I was recently surrounded by an overgrown, repulsive forest. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.corrupted_forest.description>我最近被丑恶蔓生的森林所包围。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.corrupted_forest.description>
  <!-- EN: suffocating trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.suffocating_trees.label>恼人的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.suffocating_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I recently walked among many dense, suffocating trees. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.suffocating_trees.description>我最近在许多茂密得令人恼火的树木之间漫步。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.suffocating_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: chaotic woods -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.chaotic_woods.label>杂乱的树林</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.chaotic_woods.label>
  <!-- EN: I recently walked among a haphazard variety of twisted trees. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.chaotic_woods.description>我最近在各种杂乱且扭曲的树木之间漫步。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.chaotic_woods.description>
  <!-- EN: distorted trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.distorted_trees.label>扭曲的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.distorted_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I recently encountered a twisted, disfigured tree. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.distorted_trees.description>我最近看到了一棵扭曲且丑陋的树。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.distorted_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: pitiful trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.pitiful_trees.label>鄙贱的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.pitiful_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I was recently surrounded by a few pathetic miniature trees. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.pitiful_trees.description>我最近被少量鄙贱且瘦削的树木所包围。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.pitiful_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: stunted trees -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.stunted_trees.label>萎缩的树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.stunted_trees.label>
  <!-- EN: I recently encountered a stunted, unattractive miniature tree. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.stunted_trees.description>我最近看到了一棵萎缩、干枯且瘦削的树。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.stunted_trees.description>
  <!-- EN: tree-free -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree.label>摆脱树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree.label>
  <!-- EN: I haven't been around any trees in a while. It's a relief! -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree.description>我已经好久没有看到树了。这可真是一种解脱！</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree.description>
  <!-- EN: tree-less -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treeless.label>树木稀少</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treeless.label>
  <!-- EN: I'm thankful for not having many trees around me. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treeless.description>谢天谢地，我附近的树木少得可怜。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treeless.description>
  <!-- EN: tree absence -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.tree_absence.label>没看到树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.tree_absence.label>
  <!-- EN: It has been a while since I’ve been near a tree – and I’m grateful for it. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.tree_absence.description>我已经有段时间没到树木的附近了——很高兴我没有这样做。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.tree_absence.description>
  <!-- EN: tree-free zone -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree_zone.label>无树之地</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree_zone.label>
  <!-- EN: It has been too long since I’ve been near a tree, and I don’t miss them at all. -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree_zone.description>我已经有段时间没到树木的附近了，我也完全不想再见到它们。</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.treefree_zone.description>
  <!-- EN: blessed tree absence -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blessed_tree_absence.label>很久没看到树木</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blessed_tree_absence.label>
  <!-- EN: It has been way too long since I’ve been near a tree, and I’m thankful for the distance! -->
  <AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blessed_tree_absence.description>我已经很久很久没看到树木了，远离它们是非常正确且明智的选择！</AM_Trees_Despised.stages.blessed_tree_absence.description>
  
  <!-- EN: low destruction, low density -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.low_destruction_low_density.label>未摧毁太多树木（低密度）</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.low_destruction_low_density.label>
  <!-- EN: We didn't get rid of many trees just because there aren't many laying around. -->
  <AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.low_destruction_low_density.description>我们并没有摧毁太多树木，因为附近的树木本来就没几棵。</AM_TreeDensityReduced.stages.low_destruction_low_density.description>
  
</LanguageData>